msgstr ""
"目標三角形数に達すると簡略化を停止します（メッシュ品質によりそれより早く停止"
"する場合があります）"

msgid ""
"Simplification stops just before shape error (or the shortest edge length) "
"becomes more than allowed value"
msgstr "形状誤差（または最短エッジ長）が許容値を超える直前に簡略化を停止します"

msgid ""
"Stop the decimation as soon as the estimated distance deviation from the "
"original mesh is more than this value"
msgstr ""
"元のメッシュからの推定距離偏差がこの値を超えるとすぐに間引きを停止します"

msgid "Shortest Edge Length"
msgstr "最短エッジ長"

msgid ""
"Stop the decimation as soon as the shortest edge in the mesh is greater than "
"this value"
msgstr "メッシュの最短エッジがこの値より大きくなるとすぐに間引きを停止します"

msgid "The minimum number of triangles (in selected region) after decimation"
msgstr "間引き後の最小三角形数（選択領域内）"

msgid "Percentage"
msgstr "パーセンテージ"

msgid "The percentage of triangles (in selected region) after decimation"
msgstr "間引き後の三角形の割合（選択領域内）"

msgid "Preview"
msgstr "プレビュー"

msgid ""
"Changing parameters will lead to update mesh in real-time, may freeze for "
"heavy operations."
msgstr ""
"パラメーターを変更するとリアルタイムでメッシュが更新されます。重い処理の場合"
"フリーズする可能性があります。"

msgid "Minimal Error First"
msgstr "最小誤差優先"

msgid "Shortest Edge First"
msgstr "最短エッジ優先"

msgid ""
"The next edge to collapse will be the one that introduced minimal error to "
"the surface"
msgstr "次に折り畳むエッジは、サーフェスへの誤差が最小となるものになります"

msgid "The next edge to collapse will be the shortest one"
msgstr "次に折り畳むエッジは最短のものになります"

msgid "Strategy"
msgstr "ストラテジー"

msgid "Defines the order of edge collapses during decimation"
msgstr "間引き中のエッジ折り畳みの順序を定義します"

msgid "Longest Edge Length"
msgstr "最長エッジ長"

msgid "Maximal possible edge length created during decimation"
msgstr "間引き中に生成される可能性がある最大エッジ長"

msgid "Max Triangle Aspect Ratio"
msgstr "最大三角形アスペクト比"

msgid ""
"Maximal possible aspect ratio of a triangle introduced during decimation"
msgstr "間引き中に導入される三角形の最大アスペクト比"

msgid "Stabilizer"
msgstr "安定化係数"

msgid ""
"Small stabilizer is important to achieve good results on completely planar "
"mesh parts, if your mesh is not-planer everywhere, then you can set it to "
"zero"
msgstr ""
"完全に平面なメッシュ部分で良好な結果を得るには小さな安定化係数が重要です。"
"メッシュが全体的に平面でない場合はゼロに設定できます"

msgid "Touch Near Boundary Edges"
msgstr "境界付近のエッジに触れる"

msgid ""
"Whether to allow collapsing edges having at least one vertex on (region) "
"boundary"
msgstr ""
"（領域）境界上に少なくとも1つの頂点を持つエッジの折り畳みを許可するかどうか"

msgid "Optimize Vertex Positions"
msgstr "頂点位置を最適化"

msgid ""
"If selected then after each edge collapse the position of remaining vertex "
"is optimized to minimize local shape change, if not selected then the edge "
"is collapsed in one of its vertices, which keeps its position"
msgstr ""
"選択すると、各エッジ折り畳み後に残存頂点の位置を最適化してローカル形状変化を"
"最小化します。選択しない場合、エッジはその頂点の一方で折り畳まれ、位置が維持"
"されます"

msgid "Angle-based Weights"
msgstr "角度ベースの重み"

msgid ""
"If unselected, then quadratic error metric is equal to the sum of distances "
"to the planes of original mesh triangles.\n"
"If selected, then the sum is weighted, and the weight is equal to the angle "
"of adjacent triangle at the vertex divided on PI (to get one after summing "
"all 3 vertices of the triangle)."
msgstr ""
"選択しない場合、二次誤差メトリクスは元のメッシュ三角形の平面への距離の合計に"
"なります。\n"
"選択すると合計が重み付けされ、重みは頂点における隣接三角形の角度をPIで割った"
"値になります（三角形の3頂点すべてを合計して1を得るため）。"

msgid "Pack Mesh"
msgstr "メッシュをパック"

msgid ""
"Whether to remove unused vertices/edges/triangles from mesh at the end of "
"the process"
msgstr "処理終了時にメッシュの未使用の頂点/エッジ/三角形を削除するかどうか"

msgid "Parallel Algorithm"
msgstr "並列アルゴリズム"

msgid ""
"Whether to select parallel (faster) or sequential (more precise) algorithms"
msgstr "並列（高速）または順次（より精密）アルゴリズムを選択するかどうか"

msgid "Subdivide Parts"
msgstr "分割パーツ"

msgid "The number of parts to split the mesh to process them in parallel"
msgstr "並列処理するためにメッシュを分割するパーツ数"

msgid ""
"The number of parts to split the mesh to process them in parallel. Larger "
"numbers here typically improve processing speed, but decrease mesh uniformity"
msgstr ""
"並列処理するためにメッシュを分割するパーツ数。大きい数値は通常処理速度を向上"
"しますが、メッシュの均一性が低下します"

msgid "Max error"
msgstr "最大誤差"

msgid ""
"Stop the decimation as soon as the estimated distance deviation from the "
"original line is more than this value"
msgstr "元のラインからの推定距離偏差がこの値を超えるとすぐに間引きを停止します"

msgid "Target edges"
msgstr "目標エッジ数"

msgid "The minimum number of edges after decimation"
msgstr "間引き後の最小エッジ数"

msgid ""
"Stabilizer is dimensionless coefficient. The larger is stabilizer, the more "
"Decimator will strive to retain the density of input points. If stabilizer "
"is zero, then only the shape of input line will be preserved, but some "
"artifacts on absolutely linear paths can be seen."
msgstr ""
"安定化係数は無次元係数です。安定化係数が大きいほど、間引きツールは入力ポイン"
"トの密度を保持しようとします。安定化係数がゼロの場合、入力ラインの形状のみが"
"保持されますが、完全に直線のパスにアーティファクトが見える場合があります。"

msgid "Longest edge length"
msgstr "最長エッジ長"

